        "sub": "{F5_UNVENTED_BLOCKED}",
        "text": "Unvented blocked fireplace: The fireplace(s) in the {BLOCKED_LOCATIONS} have been sealed, but no ventilation to the redundant flue was evident. Unventilated flues can trap moisture, increasing the risk of dampness, condensation, and deterioration of the chimney structure. A suitably qualified contractor should inspect the flue and install appropriate permanent ventilation, such as ventilating air bricks or flue vents, where required. This work should be carried out soon to reduce the risk of moisture-related defects.",
